{
  "_comment": [
    "Activity -> the monsters it is actually fought against.",
    "",
    "The baseline library is organised by activity, and 34 of its 99 entries are",
    "encounters rather than single monsters, so a name lookup misses them. They",
    "are also the most interesting content in the game: every raid, the Inferno,",
    "the Colosseum, Barrows, the Gauntlet. The calculator already carries stats",
    "for essentially all of the individual bosses, so nothing here needs new data",
    "- only the mapping that says which ones an activity means.",
    "",
    "Entries with an empty target list are recorded deliberately, not left out.",
    "A skilling activity has no DPS answer, and saying so here is what stops it",
    "looking like an oversight later.",
    "",
    "`inputs` overrides the encounter settings the calculator otherwise defaults:",
    "party size, Challenge Mode, invocation level, defence reductions."
  ],

